                     The Manifesto
============================================================

Any content on this website is free to take! All information
and opinions and programs are subject to change at any time.
Reader beware. Nate is a dumbass and occasionally makes some
mistakes. Critically evaluate the information on this site.


                     The Organization
============================================================

The ./index.html gathering place of all thoughts.
But thoughts live in the ./thoughts/ directory.
Everything else is irrelevant.

The pages are generated. Write posts in ./src/posts/ (Typst),
list them in ./src/posts.typ, then run ./build.sh to regenerate
./index.html and ./thoughts/*.html. Needs typst >= 0.15.


